      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've already tried running valgrind but because this is embedded hardware i don't have the full overhead to run it easily there. the leak is really subtle. what other specific code patterns or common C++ pitfalls should i be looking for that usually cause these slow, creeping leaks?",
      "source": "evaluator"
